## Final2 partial-rollback security supplement

Decision: **SOURCE SECURITY APPROVED CONDITIONAL ON THE SINGLE FULL 150 GREEN GATE**, separate independent protocol review and later native SDK/integration acceptance. This supersedes the pending partial-diff review status, not any historical failure evidence. The stopped full 127 remains superseded and is never counted as PASS.

Frozen final2 tool 2c7e00ba992b6a1d511cf09174d9cb626958c13de50d75dc8c4d15ba9d3efe1e, unchanged accepted tests 882ec1a7ce03d71e369357e2174954092078cf7c152bf811f10d4bba5ef58fbc and operations d9dfc0f2b0662c0de5e36a0b9de2ca3dea35923b18e30063e19bf4cccddd3f19 match the announced inputs. Main patch 1dad0e8542316e42b20c8caf3a99f857ea95a21f14954aa4a5f7f4d6310816ee and narrow partial delta 76357ef213851438f4208f1f1ebcd1450e6c283902c803e9dd032435cd27f2c1 are hash-verified. The delta adds no wire, public clock, dependency or permission bypass.

Review confirms: valid committed preactivation prefixes can enter conditional restore; release aggregates remain absent for never-activated plans, mandatory and typed for active proof, and complete/typed if retained during restore. Null verifyStage is accepted only for nonreleased held rollback, not as an active proof shortcut. Admission freezes restoreMaxApplyUnit before its new control receipt, preserves it across new owner/epoch recovery, and refuses applying restored plans. Recovery still rechecks bounded native receipt/head/source proofs with current custody before inverses.

Every owned inverse validates its current target through the sealed immutable receipt/head chain and rechecks canonical parent native create identity. With an owned counter head, current parent version remains the exact verified effectiveHead version, including valid later owned inverse versions. Without that head, parent.updateTime must equal the literal original.source.episodeVersion before any inverse. Missing/deleted/recreated parent, equal-value parent ABA and changed comment version are refused without source adoption, resurrection or canonical content/status writes. The same transaction contains these fresh reads, conditional inverse, receipt, progress and lease renewal. Successful rollback ends restored-held/paused; it cannot manufacture release metadata or reopen old arithmetic/traffic.

Independent final2 focused check: 15/15 PASS, 0 failures/skips/cancellations, 49153.012499 ms. Cases cover legitimate staging and mixed finalized/partial restoration, all 5 late parent/comment CAS guards, lost inverse ACK plus fresh-owner/lease frozen-prefix recovery, authenticated cursor refusal/genuine progress, public clock refusal/runtime live lease and closed episode proof payload. This independently verifies the previously exposed parent edit/ABA gap after entry admission without counting masked refusal as a fix. Author 87/87 focused and Functions 328/lint/syntax are supporting evidence; full 150 is a separate running condition at this cutpoint, not a claimed result.

